.TH RATASH-PROFILE-ADD 1 2026-08-01 "Ratash 0.1.3" "Ratash User Commands"
.SH NAME
ratash\-profile\-add \- Download, validate, and save an HTTP(S) subscription
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBratash profile add\fR [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISUBSCRIPTION_URL\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Download, validate, and save an HTTP(S) subscription
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit a versioned JSON document or NDJSON stream
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISUBSCRIPTION_URL\fR>
HTTP(S) subscription URL
